# Flecha: chrome.flechaPrivate.setTabFreezing(tabId, canFreeze) holds or drops a performance_manager FreezingVote for a tab, so the shell can freeze background tabs (another Space's, say) without discarding them. Chromium still refuses to freeze a page that plays audio, captures, uses WebRTC and so on.
