+    // Votes for the browser to freeze a tab (<code>canFreeze</code>), or
+    // takes the vote back. A frozen page keeps its memory and state but runs
+    // no tasks until it is shown or the vote is taken back. The browser
+    // freezes it only while nothing keeps it running (audio, capture, WebRTC
